764</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1073/pnas.0711400105</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kieba</surname><given-names>IR</given-names></name><name><surname>Fong</surname><given-names>KP</given-names></name><name><surname>Tang</surname><given-names>HY</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoffman</surname><given-names>KE</given-names></name><name><surname>Speicher</surname><given-names>DW</given-names></name><name><surname>Klickstein</surname><given-names>LB</given-names></name><name><surname>Lally</surname><given-names>ET</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>Aggregatibacter actinomycetemcomitans </italic>leukotoxin requires <italic>beta</italic>-sheets 1 and 2 of the human CD11a <italic>beta</italic>-propeller for cytotoxicity</article-title><source>Cell Microbiol</source><year>2007</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>2689</fpage><lpage>2699</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17587330</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1462-5822.2007.00989.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fong</surname><given-names>KP</given-names></name><name><surname>Pacheco</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Otis</surname><given-names>LL</given-names></name><name><surname>Baranwal</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kieba</surname><given-names>IR</given-names></name><name><surname>Harrison</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Hersh</surname><given-names>EV</given-names></name><name><surname>Boesze-Battaglia</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Lally</surname><given-names>ET</given-names></name></person-group><article-title><italic>Actinobacillus actinomycetemcomitans </italic>leukotoxin requires lipid microdomains for target cell cytotoxicity</article-title><source>Cell Microbiol</source><y